# for the Kali copy that is worth keeping.
src/ORCHESTRATION/BIBL/archive/

# MorphogenesisWorm staging output (2026-10-02). Every file under here is
# auto-generated ("do not edit by hand"), non-autonomous -- execute() only
# records evidence -- and named `gen_<worm>_<unknown|nature>.py`. The migration
# ledger quarantined the 91-file set (`keep iff a unit claims a file`) and no
# unit does, so they are excluded rather than adopted. `pyrightconfig.json`
# already excludes the same glob; this stops them entering `git status` as
# invisible work as well. Delete this line only alongside a claim on a file.
src/CORE/WORMS/expansion/generated/_staging/

